  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table align=\"center\" style=\"border:#7E938E 3px solid; padding:5px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/central/images/e/e7/Walter-plain.png/revision/latest?cb=20120418215241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Walter-plain\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/central/images/e/e7/Walter-plain.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20120418215241\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"151\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Walter-plain.png\" data-image-key=\"Walter-plain.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 0px 0px 0px 10px; border: none; text-align:justify;\">\n<p>Hi, my name is Sena, and I'm the Implementation Director: Strategic Partnerships. I work to help get Official Communities set up and off the ground.  \n</p><p>Some examples of Official Communities are:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"free\" href=\"https://memory-alpha.fandom.com/wiki/Trek_Initiative_Wiki\">http://trekinitiative.wikia.com/wiki/Trek_Initiative_Wiki</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"free\" href=\"https://planetside.fandom.com/wiki/PlanetSide_2_Wiki\">http://planetside.wikia.com/wiki/PlanetSide_2_Wiki</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"free\" href=\"https://everquest.fandom.com/wiki/EverQuest_Wiki\">http://everquest.wikia.com/wiki/EverQuest_Wiki</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"free\" href=\"https://eq2.fandom.com/wiki/EverQuest_2_Wiki:Main_Page\">http://eq2.wikia.com/wiki/EverQuest_2_Wiki:Main_Page</a></li></ul>\n<p>In my free time I'm a big reader, writer, and TV/movie watcher.  Right now I'm probably watching/reading <a href=\"https://hellonwheels.fandom.com/wiki/Hell_on_wheels_Wiki\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:hellonwheels:Hell on wheels Wiki\">Hell on Wheels</a>, <a href=\"https://indeath.fandom.com/wiki/In_Death_Wiki\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:indeath:In Death Wiki\">the In Death series</a>, <a href=\"https://deadwood.fandom.com/wiki/Deadwood_Wiki\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:deadwood:Deadwood Wiki\">Deadwood</a>, <a href=\"https://nikita2010.fandom.com/wiki/Nikita_Wiki\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:nikita2010:Nikita Wiki\">Nikita</a>, <a href=\"https://bones.fandom.com/wiki/Bones_Wiki\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:bones:Bones Wiki\">Bones</a>, <a href=\"https://anitablake.fandom.com/wiki/Anita_Blake_Wiki\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:anitablake:Anita Blake Wiki\">Anita Blake</a>, <a href=\"https://topgear.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:topgear:Main Page\">Top Gear</a>, <a href=\"https://dresdenfiles.fandom.com/wiki/Dresden_Files\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dresdenfiles:Dresden Files\">The Dresden Files</a> and many others.  Yes I am an Entertainment addict, I can't help myself! \n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261118101305\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.022 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 8/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n</p><p><!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_wikia:pcache:idhash:182970-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261118101305 and revision id 1740622. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n</p>\n<pre>-->\n\n</p></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 202611